#=== DOMAIN 2 (forward) ===
D2: A=2, q=(196418,317811) carried, N=24, n_start=19, Δ_start=2^38=274877906944
  Δ: 2^38 → 2^84 (n:19..42, 24 orientations, final 2^(2·42))
  on saturation: L3 → A=3, N=48
GENERAL: deterministic clockwork; numbers {6,12,24,4096,2^36,17,…} DERIVED not imposed

#=== LENS MATRIX Ω (Orthad) ===
Ω = diag(a_0,…,a_{m-1}); a_{m-1}=active, rest latched
a ∈ ℂ: anchor(a)=|a|=r_n=1/(uv) ; phase(a)=a/|a|=i^k, k=Q-ticks_in_current_domain
init: Ω=[1] (r=1, k=0)
MUTATIONS (Orthad observes word; does NOT decide):
  Update_Q: a_active ·= i              #dim const
  Update_B: w=1/(v(u+v)); a_active = w·i^k = (w/r)·a_active  #real scale, phase preserved, dim const
  Update_L: latched.append(a_active); a_active=1; rank+=1     #⊥ extend

#--- LENS TRACE Domain 0 (word = B Q Q B B B Q B Q B B Q B B L) ---
  init        a=1
  B (1,2)     a=1/2
  Q           a=i/2
  Q           a=-1/2
  B (2,3)     a=-1/6
  B (3,5)     a=-1/15
  B (5,8)     a=-1/40
  Q           a=-i/40
  B (8,13)    a=-i/104
  Q           a=1/104       #i^4
  B (13,21)   a=1/273
  B (21,34)   a=1/714
  Q           a=i/714       #i^5=i
  B (34,55)   a=i/1870
  B (55,89)   a=i/4895
  L           latch i/4895; active=1; rank=2
Ω_afterL1 = diag( i/4895 , 1 )
Ω_afterL2 = diag( i/4895 , -i/(196418·317811) , 1 )

PHASE_INVARIANT: #Q-ticks_in_domain = N-1; phase=i^{N-1}
  D0: N=6 → 5 Q → i^5=i ;  D1: N=12 → 11 Q → i^11=-i
  half-turn diff i vs -i = (-1)  ⇒ carried-phase doubling: level-6 → level-12 sign character (no reset)
LENS≠LOG: each entry = geometric invariant (anchor=resolution floor, phase=net rotation @ saturation)

#=== CHANNEL FIELD (terminal readout @ boundary; NOT a scalar) ===
field = {∀ axis a_k: (domain, status, anchor=|a_k|, phase=a_k/|a_k| ∈ {1,i,-1,-i})}
readout @ afterL2:
  a0  D0  latched   1/4895                      i   (i^1, 5 Q-ticks)
  a1  D1  latched   1/(196418·317811)≈1.60e-11  -i  (i^3, 11 Q-ticks)
  a2  D2  active    1                           1   (frontier, 0 ticks)

#=== SHADOW RESIDUAL (external; NEVER loaded into lift) ===
R(q) = Σ χ_12(n)·n·q^(n²/24)            #Ramanujan q-series, level-12
map: anchor ↔ cusp width ; phase ↔ sign-character contribution
  net phase diff (-1) over latched axes ⇒ level-6 → level-12 (true residual structure)
terminal_projector (post-process, outside Orthad, no search):
  Σ_k contribution(latched_k) weighted by (anchor_k · phase_k) → reconstruct q-series coeffs
Orthad "follows" R via deterministic word only; never carries R

#=== MACRO-CALCULUS (engineered witness, NON-primitive) ===
grammar {R,S,T}; window W=64 (static); global floor Δ=4096 (static)
  T fires @ t≡63 mod64 (clock-horizon, replaces saturation sensor)
  T resets q→(1,A+1)  #vs primitive: carry unchanged
  produces 256-step trace → canonical anchor
  +54 extra Q (burn ticks post-saturation; absent in primitive)
STATUS: legitimate specialisation, non-primitive. Universal law = dynamic saturation-driven proc above.

#INVARIANT-CORE: non-discharge + least-action continuation; geometric budget only; no external clock; no fixed W
